<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Bo cai Windows Installer (.msi) cho DF Local Agent - dong goi bang WiX Toolset v5.
  Dung dinh dang MSI + ServiceInstall/ServiceControl native (khong shell ra sc.exe an cua
  so nhu ban Inno Setup .exe) de giam nguy co bi Windows Defender gan nhan heuristic
  "dropper" (Program:Win32/Wacapew.A!ml) - xem session-log.md muc lien quan toi 404 tai
  cong cu DF Agent (2026-07-29).

  KHONG con man hinh cau hinh, KHONG con Custom Action sinh appsettings.json luc cai (da bo
  sau khi gap MSI error 1721 "A program run as part of the setup did not finish as expected"
  tren may that 2026-07-30 — deferred Custom Action goi PowerShell qua token [~] khong dang
  tin cay bang, kho debug tu xa). Don gian hon nhieu la dong goi THANG 1 file appsettings
  tinh co san qua bien tien xu ly AppSettingsFile — khong can Custom Action nao het ngoai
  ServiceInstall/ServiceControl native cua MSI.

  ====================================================================================
  TU 2026-08-03: MOT file .wxs, HAI SAN PHAM DOC LAP (yeu cau nguoi dung "tach ra lam 2
  agent, 2 bo cai khong lien quan den nhau"):

      can nho     -> DFAgentSetup-CanNho.msi      | service DFAgentSmall  | DFAgent-Small
      can to      -> DFAgentSetup-CanTo.msi       | service DFAgentLarge  | DFAgent-Large
      can to IN/OUT -> DFAgentSetup-CanTo-InOut.msi | chay trong phien user | DFAgent-Large-InOut

  TU 2026-08-05: tram CAN TO co HAI bo cai, cai chong len nhau tren cung mot may (yeu cau
  nguoi dung "tach thanh 2 bo cai rieng biet cho can to"). Mot bo lo NHAN CAN (service), mot
  bo lo IN/OUT (chay trong phien nguoi dung) — bat buoc phai tach vi hai viec doi hai cach
  chay khac han nhau, xem ghi chu RunMode ben duoi. Hai bo dung chung MOT ma tram
  (WS-LARGE-<TEN MAY>, do deu de trong Workstation:Id va cung ScaleKind=LARGE) nen man hinh
  khong phai biet may nay dang chay may Agent.

  Doc lap that su, khong chia se gi ngoai ma nguon:
    · UpgradeCode KHAC NHAU  -> cai/go/nang cap ban nay khong dung gi toi ban kia. Neu dung
      chung UpgradeCode thi MajorUpgrade cua ban thu hai se TU GO ban thu nhat - dung cai
      loi can tranh.
    · Ten service khac nhau  -> 2 service cung chay song song tren 1 may duoc.
    · Thu muc cai khac nhau  -> ke ca agent_cache.db (hang doi offline) cung tach rieng, vi
      OfflineQueue dat file ngay canh file .exe.
    · appsettings khac nhau  -> ScaleKind SMALL/LARGE quyet dinh tien to ma tram va truong
      scale_kind gui kem so can.

  Component KHONG con dong cung Guid: hai san pham cai vao HAI thu muc khac nhau, ma quy tac
  component cua Windows Installer cam mot Guid tro toi hai duong dan khac nhau. De WiX v5 tu
  sinh Guid on dinh theo duong dan key path la dung nhat.

  Build (xem agent/installer/build.ps1 — script build ca .NET publish lan 2 file MSI):
    wix build DFAgentSetup.wxs -ext WixToolset.UI.wixext ^
        -d ProductLabel="Can nho" -d ServiceName=DFAgentSmall ^
        -d InstallFolderName=DFAgent-Small -d AppSettingsFile=appsettings.small.json ^
        -d UpgradeGuid=CD108F1A-FCE9-46F2-B991-372D89E0E9D1 -o DFAgentSetup-CanNho.msi
  ====================================================================================

  Khong con Token — backend (AgentAuth middleware) tu tao/nhan Workstation theo
  workstation_id khi khong co token, danh doi bao mat da duoc nguoi dung xac nhan (xem
  session-log.md).
-->
<?ifndef ProductLabel?>
<?define ProductLabel = "Can nho"?>
<?endif?>
<?ifndef ServiceName?>
<?define ServiceName = "DFAgentSmall"?>
<?endif?>
<?ifndef InstallFolderName?>
<?define InstallFolderName = "DFAgent-Small"?>
<?endif?>
<?ifndef AppSettingsFile?>
<?define AppSettingsFile = "appsettings.small.json"?>
<?endif?>
<!--
  RunMode — CACH CHAY cua Agent sau khi cai. Day la khac biet lon nhat giua 2 ban:

    service (CAN NHO, CAN TO) : Windows Service LocalSystem, tu chay khi bat may, khong can
                                ai dang nhap. Dung cho viec doc can + day so len backend.

    session (CAN TO IN/OUT)   : KHONG cai service, thay bang shortcut trong Startup + Start
                                Menu, chay bang chinh tai khoan dang dang nhap.

  Vi sao bo IN/OUT bat buoc phai la "session": khoi SEND OVER 6 (nut IN/OUT) day ma rack sang
  ung dung pha mau bang MO PHONG CHUOT + CLIPBOARD (RackSender, ADR-012). Windows tu Vista
  co "session 0 isolation": tien trinh chay duoi Service nam o session 0, RIENG BIET voi
  phien dang nhap cua tho — SetCursorPos/mouse_event ban vao desktop cua session 0 va
  clipboard cung la clipboard rieng cua window station do, nen ung dung pha mau ben phien
  nguoi dung KHONG BAO GIO nhan duoc gi. Te hon: thao tac van "thanh cong" tren giay
  (SetClipboardText tra ve true) nen Agent ack DONE trong khi thuc te khong dan duoc ma nao.
  Ban VBA goc chay trong Excel — tuc trong phien nguoi dung — nen moi lam duoc viec nay.

  Doi lai: che do session chi chay khi da co nguoi dang nhap, va tho co the lo dong cua so
  console. Voi rieng viec IN/OUT thi khong sao — ung dung pha mau cung chi ton tai khi co
  nguoi dang nhap, va man hinh /weighing-station-large bao ro "Agent tren may tram CHUA lay
  lenh" khi khong ai xu ly lenh trong ~12 giay (xem services/rackDispatch.ts), nen tat nham
  la biet ngay chu khong am tham. Viec DOC CAN thi van de service cho chac: no phai song ke
  ca khi chua ai dang nhap.
-->
<?ifndef RunMode?>
<?define RunMode = "service"?>
<?endif?>
<!-- Ban CAN NHO giu nguyen UpgradeCode lich su (CD108F1A-...) de tu go sach cac ban da cai
     ngoai xuong: 3 ban 1.4.x theo vai tro cu (print-station / weighing-printer /
     weighing-scale) va ban 2.x service "DFAgent". Ban CAN TO dung mot Guid HOAN TOAN MOI —
     day chinh la thu lam hai bo cai khong lien quan gi den nhau. -->
<?ifndef UpgradeGuid?>
<?define UpgradeGuid = "CD108F1A-FCE9-46F2-B991-372D89E0E9D1"?>
<?endif?>
<?ifndef PackageVersion?>
<!-- 2.1.0.0 (2026-08-01): doi han cach doc can — doc duoi file log PuTTY (Scale:Source=
     PUTTY_LOG, dung cach he Excel VBA cu) o nhip 10ms, tach nhip DOC khoi nhip DAY len
     backend.

     2.2.0.0 (2026-08-01): mot bo cai dung cho MOI may — Workstation:Id de trong, Agent tu
     sinh ma tram tu TEN MAY.

     3.0.0.0 (2026-08-03): tach lam HAI bo cai doc lap (can nho / can to). Nhay major vi ban
     can nho doi ca ten service (DFAgent -> DFAgentSmall) lan thu muc cai (DFAgent ->
     DFAgent-Small): may pilot dang cai 2.2.0.0 phai nang cap qua MajorUpgrade de service cu
     duoc go sach truoc, khong de lai service "DFAgent" mo coi tro toi thu muc da xoa.

     3.1.0.0 (2026-08-03): Agent day so can len NHIEU backend cung luc (Backend:Urls), de mo
     man hinh can bang localhost hay bang IP server deu thay so — xem Worker.ResolveBackendUrls.
     Kem theo: chi ghi log khi tinh trang mot backend DOI, khong con spam 5 dong/giay.

     3.2.0.0 (2026-08-03): them SEND OVER 6 — Agent mo phong chuot/ban phim day ma rack sang
     ung dung pha mau (RackSender, port 1-1 tu VBA scaleform/Mod_sendRackauto, xem ADR-012).
     Chi ban CAN TO co muc cau hinh "Rack" trong appsettings; mac dinh Enabled=false nen nang
     cap len ban nay KHONG lam may nao tu nhien chiem chuot.

     3.3.0.0 (2026-08-04): sua loi bo cai CAN TO khong tu hien ra tram tai may tram. Hai thay doi:
     (1) Agent BAO DANH voi backend moi 60 giay (POST /api/devices/hello), khong con phu thuoc
     vao viec doc duoc so can — cai xong la tram hien ra, thieu tin hieu can chi con la canh bao
     rieng tren man hinh; (2) ban CAN TO co Scale:LogFilePathFallback tro ve duong dan chuan cu
     D:\scale\putty_log.txt, dung cho may tram chi mo MOT PuTTY (file rieng putty_log_large.txt
     van duoc uu tien tuyet doi).

     4.0.0.0 (2026-08-05): them bo cai THU BA — DFAgentSetup-CanTo-InOut.msi — chay trong
     PHIEN NGUOI DUNG (RunMode=session) va chi lam viec IN/OUT (SEND OVER 6). Hai bo cu giu
     nguyen la Windows Service. Ly do khong gop chung: xem ghi chu RunMode phia tren.
     Kem theo: agent_cache.db chuyen tu thu muc cai sang LocalAppData — tai khoan thuong
     KHONG ghi duoc vao Program Files, ma bo IN/OUT chay bang chinh tai khoan cua tho; lan
     chay dau tu chuyen kho cu (neu co) sang cho moi.

     4.1.0.0 (2026-08-05, chieu): sua loi man hinh can bao "MAT TIN HIEU" nhap nhay du Agent
     van day so deu. Hai thay doi:
       (1) Worker.cs: moi backend trong Backend:Urls co MOT nhip day rieng. Truoc day ca luot
           day la mot Task.WhenAll chung nen nhip that = nhip cua backend CHAM NHAT.
       (2) Cau hinh: bo 'http://127.0.0.1:8500/api' khoi ca 3 bo cai (may tram khong chay
           backend cuc bo), va ban CAN TO doi sang 192.168.250.151 - dung dia chi may tram do
           dung de vao giao dien, di thang trong mang noi bo thay vi vong qua router.
     Nhay minor chu khong phai major: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode, nen
     may dang chay 4.0.0.0 chi can cai de len la xong. -->

<!-- 4.2.0.0 (07/08/2026) — DUONG CAN CUC BO, ADR-013.
     Agent mo mot endpoint HTTP CHI NGHE tren 127.0.0.1 (SMALL 8770 / LARGE 8771); trinh duyet
     tren CHINH may tram doc so can thang o do thay vi vong qua backend. Do duoc: 1 lan goi ~2ms
     va so can khong bao gio cu qua 15ms, thay cho 400-900ms cua duong cu (hai lan cho nhip 200ms
     + hai chang mang qua mot backend xu ly tuan tu).
     Duong cu GIU NGUYEN lam du phong: Agent van day so len backend y nhu truoc, man hinh tu roi
     ve do khi khong goi duoc cong cuc bo.
     Ban RACK_ONLY (CanTo-InOut) khong mo cong nao - no khong doc can, va mo ra la co the giành
     mat cong cua ban CanTo cai cung may.
     Nhay minor: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode, nen may dang chay 4.0/4.1
     chi can cai de len la xong. -->

<!-- 4.3.0.0 (07/08/2026) — va SendTextToApp: bo sung 2 lenh DoEvents cua ban VBA goc.
     Doi chieu lai nguon that (giai nen vbaProject.bin cua "5.Semiauto- lockmove SEND OVER6 -
     delta-stable-final-221.xlsm") thay ModAPI_mouse.SendTextToApp co DoEvents GIUA ClickAt va
     SendKeys "^v", va them mot cai sau do nua. Ban port bo mat ca hai -> Agent ban Ctrl+V vai
     micro-giay sau cu click, luc app dich chua kip doi tieu diem, ma rack roi vao o dang focus
     truoc do hoac mat han. Thay bang nghi 60ms (Rack:PasteDelayMs).
     Nhay minor: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode. -->
<!-- 4.5.0.0 (07/08/2026) — port not cuoi con thieu cua "SEND OVER 6": SetTopMost Me, False/True.
     Ban VBA goc mo dau moi luot ban bang 'SetTopMost Me, False' - go form Excel khoi mat truoc
     de cua so ung dung pha mau lo ra, nen cu 'ClickAt 10, 100' roi DUNG vao no. Ban port bo doan
     nay voi ly do "Agent khong co form nen khong co gi de go" - dung cau chu, sai he qua: cai
     che ung dung pha mau bay gio la TRINH DUYET CHAY TOAN MAN HINH (F11/kiosk) cua man can. Ket
     qua: click (10,100) trung trinh duyet, 6 lan Ctrl+V do vao trang web, ma Agent van ack DONE
     vi moi lenh Win32 deu tra ve thanh cong - bao thanh cong gia.
     Sua: Agent tim cua so dich theo Rack:TargetWindowTitle / Rack:TargetProcessName, dua len
     truoc, XAC MINH da o truoc that (AttachThreadInput + cho co kiem tra) roi moi ban; ban xong
     tra tieu diem ve trinh duyet (= SetTopMost Me, True). Khong xac dinh duoc cua so dich thi
     BAO HONG kem ly do cu the (hien thang tren man can) thay vi ban mu - Rack:RequireTargetWindow
     mac dinh true; dat false de quay ve hanh vi 4.4.
     Nhay minor: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode. -->

<!-- 4.6.0.0 (07/08/2026) — CAI XONG LA CHAY, khong phai khai bao gi.
     Ban 4.5.0.0 bat dien Rack:TargetWindowTitle (tieu de cua so ung dung pha mau) moi ban duoc.
     Nghi lai thi chinh ban VBA goc CUNG KHONG BIET ung dung pha mau ten gi: 'SetTopMost Me, False'
     chi day cai dang che xuong duoi roi click thang vao toa do, cai gi nam do thi nhan.
     Lam dung nhu vay: nhin xem cua so nao dang nam duoi cac toa do sap click (WindowFromPoint, bo
     phieu theo da so cac diem), thay TRINH DUYET thi day xuong day (SetWindowPos HWND_BOTTOM - co
     y khong thu nho, de trinh duyet khong bung ra khoi toan man hinh) roi nhin lai; cai lo ra
     chinh la ung dung pha mau. Ban xong tra tieu diem ve trinh duyet.
     TargetWindowTitle/TargetProcessName van con nhung TUY CHON - chi dien khi vung toa do co nhieu
     cua so chong nhau va buoc tu do chon nham.
     Khong xac dinh duoc cua so dich van BAO HONG kem ly do cu the tren man can, khong ban mu.
     Nhay minor: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode. -->
<!-- 4.7.0.0 (08/08/2026) — ban IN/OUT CHAY NGAM O KHAY HE THONG (nhu WeChat).
     Yeu cau nguoi dung: "du tat X thi van chay ngam". Ban IN/OUT bat buoc chay trong phien nguoi
     dung nen no hien ra la mot cua so console tren thanh tac vu — tho thay cua so la de bam X, va
     the la nut IN/OUT chet cam cho toi khi co nguoi biet duong bat lai bang Start Menu.
     KHONG the bat su kien bam X cua cua so console (cua so do thuoc conhost.exe, va CTRL_CLOSE_EVENT
     chi cho don dep chu khong huy duoc lenh dong), nen lam nguoc lai: vao la AN han cua so, Agent
     nam o khay he thong; bam dup xem nhat ky, chuot phai de an/hien hoac Thoat han (co hoi lai).
     Luc cua so nhat ky hien thi nut X cua no bi go khoi menu he thong (xam di) — lo tay bam cung
     khong tat mat Agent. Kem theo: chan chay TRUNG BAN (Mutex theo phien) vi khong con cua so tren
     thanh tac vu thi rat de bam shortcut lan hai vi tuong chua chay, ma hai ban la hai vong lay
     lenh rack tranh nhau mot hang doi.
     Bat bang Tray:Enabled trong appsettings — CHI ban IN/OUT co; hai ban chay service khong doi gi
     (session 0 khong co thanh tac vu de hien bieu tuong).
     Nhay minor: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode. -->
<!-- 4.8.0.0 (09/08/2026) — CAN TO: het nhap nhay so can, va NEXT chot duoc bi.
     Log that cua cai can to phat XEN KE mot dong so that roi mot dong "0000000":
         US,+000466.6  g
         0000000
     Agent lay "dong cuoi cung khong rong" nen cu mot nhip trung so that, mot nhip trung 0 — ma
     "0000000" parse ra 0.0 hoan toan hop le. Hai hau qua: so can nhap nhay dung-roi-0, va
     StableFilter khong bao gio thay 2 lan doc lien tiep giong nhau nen bam NEXT khong chot duoc bi
     ("luc duoc, luc lay duoc la 00").
     Sua 1: ScaleReader.LaDongSoCan() — bo qua dong TOAN CHU SO khi chon dong cuoi. Dieu kien dat
     hep nhat co the: khung can that luon co it nhat mot ky tu khong phai chu so (dau ",", dau +/-,
     dau thap phan, chu ST/US/g).
     Sua 2: StableFilter nhan TOKEN SO thay vi ca dong tho — dung nhu VBA PushRawToForm goi
     StableFilter(rawNum). Dong cua can to mang co ST/US o dau va co nay nhay lien tuc ngay ca khi
     con so dung yen, nen so tren dong tho thi bo dem bi reset mai mai.
     Nhay minor: khong doi ten service, thu muc cai hay UpgradeCode. -->
<?define PackageVersion = "4.8.0.0"?>
<?endif?>
<Wix xmlns="http://wixtoolset.org/schemas/v4/wxs">
  <Package Name="DF Local Agent ($(var.ProductLabel))"
           Manufacturer="DF Factory Systems"
           Version="$(var.PackageVersion)"
           UpgradeCode="$(var.UpgradeGuid)"
           Language="1033"
           Scope="perMachine"
           InstallerVersion="500"
           Compressed="yes">

    <!-- AllowDowngrades="yes" giu nguyen tu ban cu: thu tu version giua cac ban cu khong
         phan anh "moi/cu" that su. -->
    <MajorUpgrade AllowDowngrades="yes" />
    <MediaTemplate EmbedCab="yes" />

    <StandardDirectory Id="ProgramFiles64Folder">
      <Directory Id="INSTALLFOLDER" Name="$(var.InstallFolderName)" />
    </StandardDirectory>

    <ComponentGroup Id="ProductComponents" Directory="INSTALLFOLDER">
      <Files Include="..\publish_release\**">
        <Exclude Files="..\publish_release\DFAgent.exe" />
        <Exclude Files="..\publish_release\appsettings.json" />
      </Files>
    </ComponentGroup>

    <Component Id="MainExecutable" Directory="INSTALLFOLDER" Bitness="always64">
      <File Id="DFAgentExe" Source="..\publish_release\DFAgent.exe" KeyPath="yes" />

<?if $(var.RunMode) = "service" ?>
      <ServiceInstall Id="DFAgentServiceInstall"
                      Name="$(var.ServiceName)"
                      DisplayName="DF Local Agent ($(var.ProductLabel))"
                      Description="Doc can dien tu qua cong COM va day so can len he thong DF (khong dung dau co dau de tranh loi encoding Service Control Manager)."
                      Type="ownProcess"
                      Start="auto"
                      ErrorControl="normal"
                      Account="LocalSystem" />

      <ServiceControl Id="DFAgentServiceControl"
                       Name="$(var.ServiceName)"
                       Start="install"
                       Stop="both"
                       Remove="uninstall"
                       Wait="yes" />
<?endif?>
    </Component>

<?if $(var.RunMode) = "session" ?>
    <!-- Chay trong PHIEN NGUOI DUNG (xem ghi chu RunMode dau file).

         Scope=perMachine nen StartupFolder/ProgramMenuFolder tro toi thu muc ALL USERS —
         ai dang nhap may nay cung co Agent chay, khong phai cai lai theo tung tai khoan.

         Show="minimized": tu 4.7.0.0 Agent tu AN han cua so console ngay khi khoi dong roi nam
         o khay he thong (Tray:Enabled, xem TrayIcon.cs), nen thuoc tinh nay chi con y nghia
         trong khoang vai phan giay dau tien truoc khi TrayIcon kip chay — de "minimized" cho
         khoang do khong loe cua so ra giua man hinh. Dat Tray:StartHidden=false trong
         appsettings thi day lai la trang thai cuoi cung cua cua so nhat ky.

         KeyPath la mot khoa registry chu khong phai shortcut: shortcut khong quang cao
         (non-advertised) khong lam KeyPath cho component perMachine duoc. -->
    <StandardDirectory Id="StartupFolder">
      <Component Id="StartupShortcut" Bitness="always64">
        <Shortcut Id="DFAgentStartupShortcut"
                  Name="DF Local Agent ($(var.ProductLabel))"
                  Description="Doc can va thuc hien lenh IN/OUT gui ma rack sang he pha mau."
                  Target="[#DFAgentExe]"
                  WorkingDirectory="INSTALLFOLDER"
                  Show="minimized" />
        <RegistryValue Root="HKLM"
                       Key="Software\DF Factory Systems\$(var.InstallFolderName)"
                       Name="StartupShortcut"
                       Type="integer"
                       Value="1"
                       KeyPath="yes" />
      </Component>
    </StandardDirectory>

    <!-- Shortcut Start Menu: de bat lai NGAY sau khi cai (shortcut Startup chi chay o lan
         dang nhap ke tiep) va de bat lai khi tho lo tat cua so. -->
    <StandardDirectory Id="ProgramMenuFolder">
      <Directory Id="DFProgramMenuDir" Name="DF Local Agent">
        <Component Id="ProgramMenuShortcut" Bitness="always64">
          <Shortcut Id="DFAgentMenuShortcut"
                    Name="DF Local Agent ($(var.ProductLabel))"
                    Description="Bat Agent doc can + IN/OUT cho tram nay."
                    Target="[#DFAgentExe]"
                    WorkingDirectory="INSTALLFOLDER"
                    Show="minimized" />
          <RemoveFolder Id="RemoveDFProgramMenuDir" Directory="DFProgramMenuDir" On="uninstall" />
          <RegistryValue Root="HKLM"
                         Key="Software\DF Factory Systems\$(var.InstallFolderName)"
                         Name="MenuShortcut"
                         Type="integer"
                         Value="1"
                         KeyPath="yes" />
        </Component>
      </Directory>
    </StandardDirectory>
<?endif?>

    <!-- appsettings.json tinh, dong san dung loai can theo bien AppSettingsFile luc build —
         khong sinh dong luc cai (xem ghi chu dau file). -->
    <Component Id="AppSettingsConfig" Directory="INSTALLFOLDER" Bitness="always64">
      <File Id="AppSettingsJson" Name="appsettings.json" Source="$(var.AppSettingsFile)" KeyPath="yes" />
    </Component>

    <Feature Id="MainFeature" Title="DF Local Agent ($(var.ProductLabel))" Level="1">
      <ComponentGroupRef Id="ProductComponents" />
      <ComponentRef Id="MainExecutable" />
      <ComponentRef Id="AppSettingsConfig" />
<?if $(var.RunMode) = "session" ?>
      <ComponentRef Id="StartupShortcut" />
      <ComponentRef Id="ProgramMenuShortcut" />
<?endif?>
    </Feature>

    <WixVariable Id="WixUILicenseRtf" Value="license.rtf" />

    <UI>
    <UIRef Id="WixUI_Common" />

    <TextStyle Id="WixUI_Font_Normal" FaceName="Tahoma" Size="8" />
    <TextStyle Id="WixUI_Font_Bigger" FaceName="Tahoma" Size="12" />
    <TextStyle Id="WixUI_Font_Title" FaceName="Tahoma" Size="9" Bold="yes" />

    <Property Id="DefaultUIFont" Value="WixUI_Font_Normal" />
    <Property Id="ARPNOMODIFY" Value="1" />

    <DialogRef Id="ErrorDlg" />
    <DialogRef Id="ExitDialog" />
    <DialogRef Id="FatalError" />
    <DialogRef Id="FilesInUse" />
    <DialogRef Id="MsiRMFilesInUse" />
    <DialogRef Id="PrepareDlg" />
    <DialogRef Id="ProgressDlg" />
    <DialogRef Id="ResumeDlg" />
    <DialogRef Id="UserExit" />
    <DialogRef Id="WelcomeDlg" />

    <Publish Dialog="ExitDialog" Control="Finish" Event="EndDialog" Value="Return" Order="999" Condition="1" />

    <!-- Khong con man hinh cau hinh nao — Welcome.Next ket thuc UI sequence ngay
         (EndDialog Return) de vao thang Progress. -->
    <Publish Dialog="WelcomeDlg" Control="Next" Event="EndDialog" Value="Return" Order="2" Condition="1" />
    </UI>

  </Package>
</Wix>
